---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/as_of.rs
expression: SELECT * FROM t LEFT ASOF JOIN u MATCH_CONDITION (t.a >= u.a) ON t.b = u.d AND t.c > 3
---
AsOfJoin LeftOuter, a#0 >= a#3, ((b#1 == d#4) and (c#2 > 3L))
:- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0, b#1, c#2]
+- Scan spark_catalog.default.u [a#3, d#4]
